cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the EnrichR-based ground-truth snapshots in this
  repository, please cite both the software (this record, via the Zenodo DOI)
  and the accompanying manuscript.
title: "HCC scRNA-seq Cell Type Annotation Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Benchmarking pipeline for hepatocellular carcinoma single-cell RNA
  sequencing cell-type annotation tools. Version 1.2.0 (second revision)
  evaluates twelve configurations of eleven tools (reference-based,
  marker-based, neural-network, foundation-model and large-language-model)
  on six cohorts, scoring every tool on the same cells with one label
  harmonisation, against investigator-curated labels, a flow-sorted cohort
  and inferCNV-based malignant-cell calls, with EnrichR-derived labels as a
  secondary concordance reference.
